# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Use this catalogue to find real repositories that demonstrate capabilities from the tutorials.
It is a learning aid, not a service inventory or a recommendation to copy a repository wholesale.
Check a repository's current status, decisions, dependencies, and security posture before reusing
an approach.

We reviewed 40 LAA Java repositories and summarised the purpose and implementation patterns visible
in their README, Gradle build, application configuration, and Docker configuration. Only evidenced
capabilities are shown; a blank cell makes no claim about that capability.

Repositories are listed alphabetically. The README link supports the purpose summary; capability
links open the repository source used for the review.

